Hi Adam,

I am really not the right person to help you out here. Thomas is offline for
a few weeks. You will have to wait till he comes back.

0.4.7a was supposed to solve the fortran linking issues. I don't have access
to any modifyable RHEL4 machine, but I did a little bit of poking around. The
linker (I think, I might be wrong) looks for the file libgfortran.a which on
debian systems is provided by gfortran-4.1. My guess is that on RHEL4 it is
provided by gcc4-gfortran-4.1.1-53.EL4 or something similar.

Hope this helps.
